WEBVTT

00:07.460 --> 00:08.230
Master Lucas!

00:09.720 --> 00:11.240
You're alive!

00:12.350 --> 00:13.660
My party....

00:14.700 --> 00:16.280
was wiped out.

01:52.260 --> 01:57.280
#7 The King Survives.

01:52.660 --> 01:54.880
Something must've happened to him.

01:54.880 --> 01:58.230
Jasmine's with him. I'm sure he's safe.

01:58.230 --> 02:01.260
But... I've got a terrible feeling.

02:01.950 --> 02:03.020
I understand.

02:03.020 --> 02:04.810
I'll make a report to the guild.

02:05.380 --> 02:07.020
Arthur...

02:08.350 --> 02:09.240
Note?

02:09.730 --> 02:10.700
Note!

02:11.880 --> 02:14.760
Thank goodness! You're awake.

02:16.030 --> 02:19.350
Elijah, one of gems... 
on my glove.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.340
Lucas.

02:44.020 --> 02:46.180
What about Jasmine?
Is she all right?

02:46.590 --> 02:47.970
She's over there.

02:48.980 --> 02:51.230
She took the full brunt of Lucas' spell,

02:51.800 --> 02:54.460
and didn't have mana protecting her body.

02:55.630 --> 02:58.040
I did what I could with 
my first-aid kit, but...

02:58.040 --> 03:00.430
I think she's got internal injuries, too.

03:02.750 --> 03:04.580
Use a gem on her, too.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.540
Her breathing has steadied.

03:12.540 --> 03:15.960
It's a good thing my mom gave 
me these healing gems.

03:18.460 --> 03:19.850
How are you feeling?

03:19.850 --> 03:22.010
Good enough to run a marathon.

03:25.510 --> 03:27.010
That being the case...

03:27.710 --> 03:30.270
I'm kind of surprised that 
the masked swordsman

03:30.270 --> 03:32.600
I was evaluated with is around my age.

03:36.310 --> 03:37.540
My mask's gone!

03:37.540 --> 03:39.390
Sorry. I couldn't find it.

03:39.390 --> 03:42.450
What about the sword?! The black 
stick that I always carry around!

03:42.450 --> 03:44.030
It's right over there.

03:44.470 --> 03:46.040
I figured I should keep it safe.

03:51.050 --> 03:54.540
Thank you for saving me and Jasmine.

03:55.540 --> 03:59.980
You could've run off if you 
wanted to. I'm really grateful.

04:02.690 --> 04:05.820
I mean, if I'd left you guys to die...

04:05.820 --> 04:09.610
I'd be just as bad as that 
piece of crap, Lucas.

04:09.610 --> 04:11.310
No, you wouldn't.

04:13.480 --> 04:16.810
I'm not letting Lucas get away with this.

04:17.350 --> 04:21.190
He was seriously trying to 
kill you... and Jasmine.

04:21.660 --> 04:22.830
You're right.

04:23.230 --> 04:25.450
<i>And yet, I...</i>

04:26.220 --> 04:27.240
Come to think of it,

04:27.240 --> 04:31.330
why didn't you run when the guardian 
spirit of the Elder Woods showed up?

04:31.960 --> 04:34.580
Jasmine seemed to want you to escape.

04:35.750 --> 04:38.090
A king does not abandon his people!

04:39.570 --> 04:41.350
What are you talking about?

04:42.830 --> 04:43.590
Besides...

04:44.230 --> 04:45.560
I made a promise.

04:45.960 --> 04:48.100
That I'd protect the people I care about.

04:50.380 --> 04:55.250
To make a promise like that... 
what kind of crazy life do you lead?

04:57.800 --> 04:59.970
How long was I out?

05:01.080 --> 05:02.990
I think it's been about a day.

05:02.990 --> 05:07.790
Okay.. And I don't think we can move 
until Jasmine is feeling better.

05:09.860 --> 05:12.620
My name is Arthur. Arthur Leywin.

05:15.020 --> 05:16.990
You can call me Art, though.

05:18.900 --> 05:22.030
Now, I know this is sudden, 
Elijah Knight of the Darv Kingdom...

05:22.850 --> 05:26.140
This is clearly not something 
that was formed naturally.

05:26.690 --> 05:29.390
Did you make this metal shelter?

05:29.990 --> 05:32.880
With my magic, as the cave was collapsing.

05:32.880 --> 05:34.140
I see.

05:34.830 --> 05:37.310
But even using special magic,

05:37.310 --> 05:39.630
it shouldn't be possible to 
create metal from nothing.

05:41.390 --> 05:44.350
Which means you're a dwarf, aren't you?

05:44.840 --> 05:47.400
I guess there's no keeping 
the secret at this point.

05:48.260 --> 05:53.300
I'm honestly not certain
 if I'm a dwarf or not myself.

05:54.430 --> 05:58.890
I was raised in Darv, but Elder Rahdeas,
 who took care of me,

05:58.890 --> 06:01.180
never wanted to talk about my parents.

06:02.040 --> 06:07.800
All I remember of my childhood are 
flashes of some really sad event.

06:09.020 --> 06:11.730
Despite all that, I had 
a normal enough life.

06:12.550 --> 06:19.910
But when I hit deep orange, this strange 
energy came over me, and I passed out.

06:23.560 --> 06:28.050
And when I woke up, I was surrounded 
by these dark shafts of metal.

06:29.530 --> 06:33.160
That was when Elder Rahdeas 
said I should leave Darv,

06:33.160 --> 06:36.980
and recommended I travel 
the rest of the Dicathen.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.770
I still don't understand why.

06:41.190 --> 06:43.450
It all happened so fast.

06:43.930 --> 06:48.510
And sometimes, I'm struck with 
that same sensation again.

06:49.230 --> 06:53.760
I'm sure that it has something to 
do with my power, and my parents.

06:54.600 --> 06:56.450
You've had a hard time yourself.

06:58.760 --> 07:04.220
I wouldn't eat that fish, Arthur! 
This one is way better...

07:09.190 --> 07:13.290
Sorry, I didn't mean to bring the 
mood down with that story.

07:13.290 --> 07:14.940
Don't worry about it.

07:14.940 --> 07:16.790
So... what about you?

07:17.940 --> 07:20.420
I told you about my 
past, so it's only fair.

07:20.420 --> 07:23.290
What was that spell that you used 
to take down the Elder Woods?

07:23.290 --> 07:27.540
Your hair turned white, and your 
body was covered in glowing marks!

07:27.540 --> 07:28.050
Well...

07:28.310 --> 07:30.300
Your eyes turned bright purple, too.

07:31.050 --> 07:32.690
Okay, fine!

07:34.550 --> 07:37.550
I'm an Augmenter who can 
use the four core elements,

07:37.550 --> 07:41.060
as well as two more. 
Ice and lightning.

07:41.060 --> 07:41.910
No way!

07:44.440 --> 07:48.770
I thought I was odd, but it 
looks like you've got me beat.

07:48.770 --> 07:50.120
Looks like it.

07:50.870 --> 07:52.110
But wait...

07:52.110 --> 07:54.570
That can't be why those marks appeared 
and your eyes changed color.

07:54.900 --> 08:01.190
I'm also a beast tamer. What you saw 
was me unleashing my Beast Will.

08:01.190 --> 08:04.500
Your Beast Will?! What even is that?!
 And how old are you?!

08:04.500 --> 08:07.090
I turned 11 two months ago.

08:07.090 --> 08:11.090
So I'm older?! I just turned 12!

08:12.470 --> 08:16.600
Then again, I doubt being older 
gives me much of an edge here.

08:20.660 --> 08:24.510
What's with that face?!
You really are the weirder one!

08:26.920 --> 08:27.670
You okay?

08:27.670 --> 08:29.390
It's... totally fine.

08:40.670 --> 08:42.280
Jasmine! Thank goodness—

08:44.140 --> 08:47.650
I'm sorry. I am so sorry!

08:48.930 --> 08:52.730
Don't worry. It's okay, Jasmine.

08:52.730 --> 08:54.130
No, it isn't!

08:54.620 --> 08:57.460
I couldn't protect you! Again!

08:59.460 --> 09:02.300
I was the one who insisted on coming.

09:02.820 --> 09:04.670
I should be the one to apologize.

09:05.970 --> 09:09.580
Things got really bad, and I dragged 
you into it. I'm sorry.

09:11.130 --> 09:14.020
<i>Was Jasmine always this small?</i>

09:15.400 --> 09:17.130
Your injuries! I'm sorry.

09:17.930 --> 09:19.590
I said it was okay.

09:21.160 --> 09:25.000
It's more important that 
we figure a way out of here.

09:35.950 --> 09:38.380
Do you think any of the others survived?

09:39.060 --> 09:43.790
Reginald and Brald were gone before 
you brought the Elder Wood down.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.790
What about Samantha?

09:47.190 --> 09:50.580
I managed to cover her in a 
shelter before the cave-in,

09:51.130 --> 09:54.200
but she was in rough shape,
 so I'm not sure.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.200
Can you look for her?

09:58.670 --> 10:01.200
My mana's recovered, 
so I should be able to.

10:17.410 --> 10:18.170
I found her.

10:25.220 --> 10:26.290
This is it.

10:43.490 --> 10:45.350
<i>His ability to detect 
things is remarkable.</i>

10:45.990 --> 10:48.870
<i>Just who is this boy?</i>

10:52.980 --> 10:54.250
Samantha!

10:57.620 --> 10:58.340
She's alive!

11:02.930 --> 11:04.010
Don't!

11:04.550 --> 11:08.870
The vine is acting like a splint,
 keeping her leg secure.

11:10.670 --> 11:14.060
Her pulse seems steady, 
and her breathing is normal.

11:15.090 --> 11:17.610
I don't think she's in any mortal danger.

11:21.190 --> 11:23.340
But she's hurt pretty bad.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.850
What about the beast 
core of the Elder Woods?

11:32.450 --> 11:35.530
I don't think we're gonna be 
able to find it in all this.

11:37.800 --> 11:39.300
The cave's collapsing!

11:57.220 --> 11:59.860
Dammit, Lucas must have done this.

12:05.640 --> 12:06.690
It's no good.

12:10.210 --> 12:10.750
Let's hurry!

12:33.730 --> 12:36.780
We're not getting out this way. 
Let's search for another route.

12:43.010 --> 12:43.780
Arthur.

12:46.830 --> 12:47.900
Underground water?

12:48.530 --> 12:49.780
This is bad.

12:49.780 --> 12:54.040
If there was enough water down here 
to feed the Elder Woods—

12:55.290 --> 12:57.290
Not good! There's nowhere we can go!

12:59.370 --> 13:01.000
Dive below the surface!

13:01.000 --> 13:02.600
Jasmine, hold onto Samantha!

13:11.100 --> 13:14.870
<i>I will not let these lives 
that I've saved be lost!</i>

13:30.610 --> 13:33.490
Jasmine? Elijah?

13:34.850 --> 13:36.200
Arthur?

13:36.200 --> 13:37.270
Thank goodness!

13:38.210 --> 13:39.460
Where are we?

13:39.940 --> 13:41.210
Beasts!

13:46.760 --> 13:48.220
There's a lot of them.

13:48.510 --> 13:49.590
And we're surrounded.

14:10.670 --> 14:12.620
We can't keep this up forever!

14:22.760 --> 14:23.720
Jasmine!

14:25.340 --> 14:26.340
Elijah!

14:35.890 --> 14:38.510
<i>Am I going to prove incapable...</i>

14:39.340 --> 14:43.340
<i>of defending those
I care about yet again?</i>

14:56.810 --> 15:03.320
<i>It seems that I will be dying 
alone in this life as well.</i>

15:04.600 --> 15:07.800
<i>Forgive me, everyone.</i>

15:19.240 --> 15:20.690
<i>Papa!</i>

15:22.950 --> 15:24.210
<i>Here I am.</i>

15:25.740 --> 15:27.100
Sylvie.

15:35.450 --> 15:37.890
You sure have grown.

15:37.890 --> 15:41.450
In weight, and width... 
to say nothing of height.

15:47.510 --> 15:49.090
Jasmine! Elijah!

15:53.410 --> 15:59.470
W-What is that? A wyvern? 
But it's got four legs...

15:59.740 --> 16:01.770
So it's a real dragon?

16:03.290 --> 16:06.410
But that can't be right.

16:06.410 --> 16:08.420
No, she's a dragon.

16:14.070 --> 16:14.910
A dragon?

16:14.910 --> 16:17.390
This is my partner, Sylvie.

16:19.010 --> 16:23.080
But dragons have supposedly
been extinct for centuries.

16:23.390 --> 16:27.880
Which is why I need you 
to keep her a secret.

16:29.330 --> 16:30.760
Is that really you, Sylvie?

16:30.760 --> 16:33.800
How many mana cores did you 
eat since I last saw you?

16:35.970 --> 16:37.470
Sylvie, no!

16:39.070 --> 16:44.770
He's 11 years old, with mastery over the 
four core elements, plus two more...

16:45.380 --> 16:47.400
and a dragon partner.

16:48.100 --> 16:51.350
He's on a totally different level.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.690
Elijah!

16:55.530 --> 16:56.250
Come on.

16:59.010 --> 16:59.910
Yeah.

17:11.420 --> 17:13.110
They're all making way!

17:28.990 --> 17:31.970
<i>But I could fly you back to town.</i>

17:31.970 --> 17:35.000
<i>People would make a huge 
fuss if they saw a dragon.</i>

17:39.430 --> 17:41.950
You look even cooler without the mask.

17:43.460 --> 17:44.600
Samantha!

17:46.510 --> 17:49.900
Don't talk. You're better off 
conserving your strength.

17:49.900 --> 17:51.020
Wait.

17:52.130 --> 17:52.810
Here.

17:53.700 --> 17:55.690
The beast core of the Elder Woods!

17:56.270 --> 17:58.090
I stumbled upon it.

17:58.410 --> 17:59.820
That's still amazing.

18:00.350 --> 18:02.970
Once things settle down, 
we'll split the take.

18:02.970 --> 18:06.350
I don't need anything.
I think you should take it.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.110
Don't look at me! I agree with her.

18:11.420 --> 18:14.130
Do you realize how much this is worth?

18:14.900 --> 18:17.930
I'm only alive because of you.

18:18.740 --> 18:23.240
It's natural that you accept the 
reward, and only fair, frankly.

18:29.240 --> 18:30.200
I understand.

18:30.770 --> 18:32.060
Thank you all.

18:36.180 --> 18:39.070
Elijah and I will go find 
some drinkable water.

18:45.660 --> 18:47.730
I'd better let my parents 
know that I'm okay.

18:58.180 --> 18:59.550
Now, then...

19:00.610 --> 19:05.670
Did you get this big by catching 
mana beasts and eating their cores?

19:05.670 --> 19:08.540
I caught a whole bunch!

19:08.540 --> 19:10.670
Can you change back to 
how you looked before?

19:37.610 --> 19:40.950
<i>Jasmine and I are both 
fine, so don't worry.</i>

19:41.540 --> 19:42.650
Arthur...

19:44.120 --> 19:47.370
It's fine! He'll be back soon.

19:49.000 --> 19:50.620
You're right.

20:04.370 --> 20:05.180
Come in.

20:06.390 --> 20:08.710
Guildmaster. You have a visitor.

20:09.090 --> 20:10.140
You're...

20:34.440 --> 20:35.130
Yes?

20:36.500 --> 20:38.020
How are you feeling?

20:38.740 --> 20:40.860
Ready to check out whenever they let me.

20:40.860 --> 20:42.530
That's good to hear.

20:42.530 --> 20:45.130
I feel like I owe you an apology.

20:45.130 --> 20:48.260
Not at all. It's nice that 
the Adventurer's Guild

20:48.260 --> 20:51.170
was able to pay back some of 
what we owe the Twinhorns.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.580
That said...

20:55.470 --> 20:57.450
Were you aware that this 
dungeon raid was done

20:57.450 --> 21:00.170
without the guild's authorization?

21:01.330 --> 21:04.130
Plus, there's been a complaint 
filed against your group,

21:04.130 --> 21:06.900
claiming you're responsible 
for how things played out.

21:08.650 --> 21:14.580
Note, there's going to be a guild council 
hearing about how to handle your case.

21:15.340 --> 21:18.210
The plaintiff is Lucas Wykes.
